start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc {dc 2ch 2dc}@ring [3ch sh@ring]x3 3ch ss@top
R2: sl sl@sp 3ch=dc {dc 2ch 2dc}@same [ch csh@sp ch sh@sp]x3 ch csh@sp ch ss@top
R3: sl sl@sp 3ch=dc {dc 2ch 2dc}@same 3ch csh@sp 3ch [sh@sp 3ch csh@sp 3ch]x3 ss@top
R4: sl sl@sp 3ch=dc {dc 2ch 2dc}@same 4ch csh@sp 4ch [sh@sp 4ch csh@sp 4ch]x3 ss@top
R5: sl sl@sp 3ch=dc {dc 2ch 2dc}@same 6ch {sh 3ch sh}@sp 6ch [sh@sp 6ch {sh 3ch sh}@sp 6ch]x3 ss@top
R6: sl sl@sp 3ch=dc {dc 2ch 2dc}@same 6ch sh@sp 2ch csh@sp 2ch sh@sp 6ch [sh@sp 6ch sh@sp 2ch csh@sp 2ch sh@sp 6ch]x3 ss@top
R7: sl sl@sp 3ch=dc {dc 2ch 2dc}@same 6ch sh@sp ch sh@sp 2ch csh@sp 2ch sh@sp 2ch sh@sp 6ch [sh@sp 6ch sh@sp ch sh@sp 2ch csh@sp 2ch sh@sp 2ch sh@sp 6ch]x3 ss@top
R8: sl sl@sp 3ch=dc {dc 2ch 2dc}@same 6ch [sh@sp 3ch]x2 csh@sp [3ch sh@sp]x2 6ch [sh@sp 6ch [sh@sp 3ch]x2 csh@sp [3ch sh@sp]x2 6ch]x3 ss@top
R9: sl sl@sp 3ch=dc {dc 2ch 2dc}@same 6ch [sh@sp 4ch]x2 csh@sp [4ch sh@sp]x2 6ch [sh@sp 6ch [sh@sp 4ch]x2 csh@sp [4ch sh@sp]x2 6ch]x3 ss@top
